recommend keep-going next crux-first agent-doable: a per-edge or per-subtree read building on the branches just named (a subtree membership or the two-way split's members, not just sizes), an object-count-in-region summary joining a selector with the manifest, a per-cluster lasso read, or a codec read; the Microkernel study rung and a real-photo top-hat wait on a fetch/license gate. No network, no key, no funds.
